<title>INDONESIA: Bre-X, Barrick still negotiating.</title>
<headline>Bre-X, Barrick still negotiating.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indonesian government is still awaiting the outcome of negotiations between Bre-X Minerals Ltd and Barrick Gold Corp with their local partners over the Busang gold find, Mines and Energy Minister Ida Bagus Sudjana said on Thursday.</p>
<p>He said in a statement answering parliamentary questions that the two Canadian companies were still negotiating with their partners ahead of a mid-February deadline set by the government.</p>
</text>
